              "text": "35",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kïtas tagh pipö Amori kïmang kutïng pö Eres nko Ayalon nko Syaalpim, wölo otini kitasa owesyö pipö ara Epraim nko Manase, kïpechï chane tïkwïl kutö pïchay kwigh ighisyo sekeynön.",
